Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Move FontForge's one-width rule into its own module

The shared advance also decides the exported .notdef and post.isFixedPitch,
so the rule is shared by more than the OS/2 defaults filter.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
